      <title>📣 PTA MEETING TOMORROW! 🐾💙💚</title>
      <description>📣 PTA MEETING TOMORROW! 🐾💙💚

Boles families, join us tomorrow, October 8, at 6:15 PM in the Boles Jr. High Cafeteria for our PTA meeting—before the band concert! 🎶

Come hear what’s happening with PTA and how you can get involved in supporting our Bulldogs! 🐾💚💙

We’d love to see you there! 💙</description>
